      section_prose(content: "Every lane below was live roadmap before the reset. Shelved = plan docs and carriers stay in place, nothing dispatches from here, and the git-history ROADMAP.md holds the full pre-reset detail (structure, milestones, sign-off states). Un-shelve by PR into §1–§3, priced in displaced cost."),
      section_group(
        label: "",
